# Every control the library has, on the test books (tools/e2e.zig plays it). Start from
# a fresh test folder whose documents hold the test book and 13 copies of it, so the
# library has two pages: noface on its library, nothing read yet. After each screen
# opens, `still` waits for it to show: noface drops a touch that lands before.
# `drawn` budgets are a few times what a Paperwhite 12th gen takes (60 ms at most).

still

# Paging: on to the second page and back
tap 832 1590
log library tap 832,1590: next
drawn 150
still
tap 440 1590
log library tap 440,1590: prev
drawn 150
still

# The filter's tabs: Unread, Read, then All again
tap 340 558
log library tap 340,558: tab
drawn 150
still
tap 500 558
log library tap 500,558: tab
drawn 150
still
tap 200 558
log library tap 200,558: tab
drawn 150
still

# Sorting: each of the six orders, round to the first
tap 1000 558
log library tap 1000,558: sort
drawn 150
still
tap 1000 558
log library tap 1000,558: sort
drawn 150
still
tap 1000 558
log library tap 1000,558: sort
drawn 150
still
tap 1000 558
log library tap 1000,558: sort
drawn 150
still
tap 1000 558
log library tap 1000,558: sort
drawn 150
still
tap 1000 558
log library tap 1000,558: sort
drawn 150
still

# Reading stats, closed by any tap
tap 758 558
log screen: Stats opened
drawn 150
still
tap 636 900
log screen: Stats closed by tap
drawn 150
still

# Searching: "scen" typed, each key drawn, then Search; tapping the hero's place clears it
tap 642 558
log screen: LibrarySearch opened
drawn 150
still
tap 264 1376
drawn 150
still
tap 512 1496
drawn 150
still
tap 326 1256
drawn 150
still
tap 884 1496
drawn 150
still
tap 954 1616
log screen: LibrarySearch done by tap
drawn 150
still
tap 636 300
log library tap 636,300: clear_search
drawn 150
still

# A book's actions, from holding it; a tap above the sheet closes it
hold 190 760 700
log screen: Sheet opened
drawn 150
still
tap 636 150
log closed by tap
drawn 150
still

# The quick panel, from the menu corner
tap 100 48
log screen: Panel opened
drawn 150
still
tap 636 1300
log screen: Panel closed by tap
drawn 150
still
